\tag{fdip}
\title{Finite exterior coefficients without factorial division}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{The [paired Grassmann convention](fdip-008F) fixes the order
of barred and unbarred generators. Over a commutative ring, the
finite products behind that convention can be formed before
any division is considered. The coefficient module is finite free
throughout this construction.}

